linux (5.10.252-4) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * config: enable CONFIG_NET_SCHED on arm64 - drop the override mask so the
    common config's scheduler block applies (qdisc modules incl. sch_netem,
    tbf, htb) for on-device network-emulation testing (tc/tcset). Default
    qdisc stays pfifo_fast: CONFIG_NET_SCH_DEFAULT is unset in the override,
    since the common CONFIG_DEFAULT_FQ_CODEL=y would otherwise flip every
    fleet interface to fq_codel. No runtime behavior change until tc is used.

 -- James Eitzmann <james@lookdeep.health>  Tue, 01 Sep 2026 11:54:37 -0400

linux (5.10.252-3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * rk-camera-module: restore the 5.10.110 struct rkmodule_inf ABI. Rockchip
    inserted pd_offset into struct rkmodule_pdaf_inf, growing rkmodule_inf
    5203 -> 5207 bytes; that size is encoded in the RKMODULE_GET_MODULE_INFO
    ioctl number, so the frozen closed AIQ v3.0x8.5 got -ENOTTY on the call
    that fetches the module/lens names. selectIqFile() then failed, no IQ file
    was loaded, 3A never started and both IMX415 sensors sat at driver
    defaults (max exposure, zero gain) - a dark image with no errors logged
    beyond a single iqfiles line. Root-caused on bench hardware (lvu-0299):
    the 5203-sized ioctl returns ENOTTY while 5207 succeeds, and librkaiq.so
    encodes the 5203 form. Drops the field, drops its five sensor-driver
    assignments, and adds a BUILD_BUG_ON so this cannot silently drift again.

 -- James Eitzmann <james@lookdeep.health>  Mon, 17 Aug 2026 11:33:04 -0400

linux (5.10.252-2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * rk3588-ks-t1: disable inherited EVB work_led node - it drives GPIO3_B7,
    which is gmac1's RTL8211F reset line; leds-gpio held the PHY in reset
    after stmmac's probe-time pulse (5.10.252 stmmac_mdio_reset now puts the
    GPIO), causing "Failed to reset the dma" on every interface open.
    Root-caused and fix verified live on bench hardware (lvu-0299).

 -- James Eitzmann <james@lookdeep.health>  Fri, 14 Aug 2026 17:14:10 -0400

linux (5.10.252-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Rebase onto rockchip develop-5.10 @ 5.10.252 (tip bfa51d2ab): ~140
    sublevels of upstream stable security fixes merged by Rockchip, rknpu
    driver 0.8.2 -> 0.9.8 (librknnrt 2.3.0-compatible, documented range).
  * KS_T1 board support now committed in-tree (formerly quilt patches
    lookdeep/0001-0008, hand-adapted; plus drivers/switch re-import,
    removed in-branch upstream).
  * rkisp v3x: restore the v2.0.0 stat-buffer ABI (a params_id field
    inserted in-branch shifted the 3A stats payload and silently broke
    the frozen AIQ v3.0x8.5 blob - AE converged ~4.5x dark). Camera
    verified at pixel parity with 5.10.110-16 on lvu-0299 (night+day).
  * Config: fleet 5.10.110-17 config migrated (new-symbol answers from
    the hardware-validated bench build; incl. new ARM64 errata =y).

